  "decisions": [
    "Negotiate configuration.transactions with existing command 0.2/result 0.1 and an 8192-byte profile frame floor. Preserve preview-only sessions without a backend.",
    "Use one populated ledger for full transactions and legacy previews; reserve original-connection replies before admission and bound all queued/running/undelivered work.",
    "Keep native preparation and store access on one worker. Require actual native join/stop before finishing its slot; owner/ticket/connection lifetime checks reject misrouted completion.",
    "Serialize cancellation and current policy at the final commit permit. After it, return pending until actual storage outcome; cancellation is never undo.",
    "Clear old-policy queued results and reauthorize retrieval/completion against the original operations. Policy-hidden facts use unknown plus policy.denied/forced under the existing schema.",
    "Verify six actual Linux IPC/thread/ext4 cases with an independent socket client and stored-document oracle. Use only owned synthetic resources and typed laboratory policy.",
    "Preserve the initial helper, warnings-as-errors, schema-mapping and historical dependency failures. Pin the installed static Concurrency Runtime and explicitly document its mandatory import floors.",
    "Expand the ordinary historical import/linker-input audit to all seventeen current portable executables without claiming historical OS execution.",
    "Keep W-08 and the complete five-family SysPane 0.1.0 release open."
  ],
